flowchart TD
    UI[Local dashboard / CSV or JSON inventory] --> J[Single worker queue]
    J --> U[User goal and selected context]
    CLI[CLI] --> U
    U --> P[PLAN: schema-validated LLM plan]
    P --> D[DECIDE: LLM native function calls]
    D --> T[TOOLS: validate scope and dispatch]
    T --> F[Context / CVE / KEV / EPSS / Vendor advisory / Asset version assessment]
    F --> O[Typed observation or error with evidence ID]
    O --> D
    T -->|LLM selected finish| R[REPORT: structured LLM judgments]
    D -->|Round or tool budget reached| R
    D -->|Model ends with text| R
    R --> V{Validate references, coverage, ranks}
    V --> C[Separate source-grounding LLM review]
    C -->|One shared repair attempt| R
    V -->|One shared repair attempt| R
    C -->|Accepted| A[JSON + Markdown + original evidence]
    A --> H[SQLite history and local task drafts]
    H --> UI
    H --> EX[Review status / CSV export / two-run observation comparison]
    X[One-shot timeout flag] -.-> F
    B[Wall-time / provider / validation failure] --> S[Explicit failed or partial run artifact]
    P -.-> L[Local JSONL events and readable transcript]
    T -.-> L
    V -.-> L
    S -.-> L
